{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"7OSPzFsJSM1I"},"source":["# **Climate Change in Fort Myers, FL**\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"8h5h-B41nBwj"},"source":["## Introduction"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"lQ371a9Y00br"},"source":["  **Climate Change** refers to long term shifts in average weather patterns and temperature trends around the world. While natural factors such as volcanic eruptions and solar fluctuations play a role, the rapidly increasing warming trend we are witnessing today is almost certainly a result of human activities. These include, but are not limited to, the burning of fossil fuels, deforestation, and large-scale agriculture, which increase the concentrations of greenhouse gases like carbon dioxide and methane in the atmosphere.  \n","\n","  In this notebook, we turn our attention to **Fort Myers, Florida**\n","  By analysing historical datasets, we plan to:  \n","  - Visualise how different variables in Fort Myers have changed over time\n","  - Fit trendlines and project these changes into the future\n","  - Interpret what those trends mean for the future.  \n","\n","  We are not only analyzing how Fort Myers has changed in the past, but also exploriring how it might continue to change."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"TnIhsmm5nCST"},"source":["## Average Temperature"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"3-NcDBZ9KAQx"},"source":["Temperature is a measure of the intensity of heat on a given day. One of the biggest factors of climate change is often regarded as global warming, the notion that Earth's surface increases in temperature over time due to human effects. In order to measure how global warming has and will continue to affect Earth, a graph is provided below which depicts the average temperature recorded per year and graphs this data in a line plot.\n","\n","In the context of our dataset, the average temperature takes the sum of the temperature every day for a month and averages it. Then, the average temperature across each month in a given year is averaged to obtain a general average temperature across the year. To prove the existence of global warming, a general upward trend must be present in the data. Given below is the code that, when run, produces the average temperature graph and the slope per year.\n","\n","**Run this code segment first before any others. Once you click run you will be prompted to upload the fortMyersWeather.zip file. This will add all the necessary documents to the workspace.**\n","\n","If needed, you can download fortMyersWeather.zip [here](https://trello.com/1/cards/68f2652a5f4424822ffb650d/attachments/6914baf4bb4209da6729351e/download/fortMyersWeather.zip)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":669},"id":"UZQW0nDvPQvM","outputId":"c948c7a4-28fb-4186-c520-37baa02e5ec0","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1765349537475,"user_tz":360,"elapsed":7375,"user":{"displayName":"David Gray","userId":"09426756811334309153"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Please upload the fortMyersWeather.zip file\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.HTML object>"],"text/html":["\n","     <input type=\"file\" id=\"files-247589c2-ccae-4335-8df9-ca68c07bdadd\" name=\"files[]\" multiple disabled\n","        style=\"border:none\" />\n","     <output id=\"result-247589c2-ccae-4335-8df9-ca68c07bdadd\">\n","      Upload widget is only available when the cell has been executed in the\n","      current browser session. Please rerun this cell to enable.\n","      </output>\n","      <script>// Copyright 2017 Google LLC\n","//\n","// Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the \"License\");\n","// you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.\n","// You may obtain a copy of the License at\n","//\n","//      http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n","//\n","/